        <li>Use the <a href="/workday-calculator/" style="color: var(--accent); font-weight: 700; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px;">Workday Calculator</a> when your deadline calculation must skip weekends and recognized international public holidays.</li>
      </ul>
